                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e48a3fc-0c0e-48d7-8dd2-ca4f4e8c0ff3",
                                                "sense_id": "e4eb9531-9d73-3220-bd96-504ee50a717a",
                                                "text": "a Nobel-winning author"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d9f1e886-a781-4b97-9047-0f684e50f062",
                        "source_entry_id": "9e85408b-718c-327b-9d35-5ad6f4ff9871",
                        "source_sense_id": "b470a215-d34f-3231-837e-a3db0ae4ed36",
                        "target_lang_word": "Prize",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fc9d93d1-bdef-4c01-872b-4fd361cf3d48",
                        "source_entry_id": "9e85408b-718c-327b-9d35-5ad6f4ff9871",
                        "source_sense_id": "b470a215-d34f-3231-837e-a3db0ae4ed36",
                        "target_lang_word": "winner",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "winner",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2aeb983a-0c4b-35cc-99f2-7f0b65036ff4",
                                        "entry_id": "bc4bd296-b09f-36f5-90cf-6f31c4b6f31d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who has won or often wins."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "010799f3-1fba-4626-a555-4f29c2b686f4",
                                                "sense_id": "2aeb983a-0c4b-35cc-99f2-7f0b65036ff4",
                                                "text": "Of all the queer collections of humans outside of a crazy asylum, it seemed to me this sanitarium was the cup winner. […] When you're well enough off so's you don't have to fret about anything but your heft or your diseases you begin to get queer, I suppose."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c88eb86-7252-4e11-bf48-780c89618376",
                                                "sense_id": "2aeb983a-0c4b-35cc-99f2-7f0b65036ff4",
                                                "text": "Remember Rappin' Duke? Duh-ha, duh-ha\nYou never thought that hip-hop would take it this far\nNow I'm in the limelight 'cause I rhyme tight\nTime to get paid, blow up like the World Trade\nBorn sinner, the opposite of a winner\nRemember when I used to eat sardines for dinner"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4fdf4118-7c24-339d-813b-af2374903664",
                                        "entry_id": "bc4bd296-b09f-36f5-90cf-6f31c4b6f31d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A point or goal that wins a competition."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25090263-76bf-4d3b-b2d8-4fd34c86d9f0",
                                                "sense_id": "4fdf4118-7c24-339d-813b-af2374903664",
                                                "text": "It was a fitting scoreline on the club's landmark anniversary, and appropriate that Van Persie should get the winner."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0e3b33ec-2a08-4cd0-aa51-2d08556f7684",
                        "source_entry_id": "9e85408b-718c-327b-9d35-5ad6f4ff9871",
                        "source_sense_id": "b470a215-d34f-3231-837e-a3db0ae4ed36",
                        "target_lang_word": "nobel",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "nobel",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "236ed174-71cb-395d-8cf5-dcc5630e9978",
                                        "entry_id": "2ffd5a7e-bf82-365b-ba5a-3ce557328b49",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Persona que ha sido galardonada con un Premio Nobel."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0330e6c6-356a-4aed-bcb1-58867438102e",
                        "source_entry_id": "9e85408b-718c-327b-9d35-5ad6f4ff9871",
                        "source_sense_id": "b470a215-d34f-3231-837e-a3db0ae4ed36",
                        "target_lang_word": "Nobelpreisträger",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Nobelpreisträger",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9133c0ba-7ca8-35f7-95cd-094e8ca25347",
                                        "entry_id": "156d18c3-ee60-39d2-adf4-63fc54846195",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Person, die mit einem Nobelpreis ausgezeichnet wurde"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "51d9ad03-a729-4875-81da-4fd5af1aa995",
                                                "sense_id": "9133c0ba-7ca8-35f7-95cd-094e8ca25347",
                                                "text": "Der Nobelpreisträger wurde als Ehrengast zum Vortrag über Nuklearphysik eingeladen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f1385f3-92f3-47a3-96bf-19a2ad024953",
                                                "sense_id": "9133c0ba-7ca8-35f7-95cd-094e8ca25347",
                                                "text": "„Sir John Eccles, Nobelpreisträger für Physiologie und Medizin, war schließlich auch gläubiger Katholik.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e649742a-104b-4186-ac35-36614a25a95f",
                                                "sense_id": "9133c0ba-7ca8-35f7-95cd-094e8ca25347",
                                                "text": "„Er hatte von Anfang an das Büro schräg gegenüber dem des Nobelpreisträgers bezogen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c3071892-45fc-4e85-beb4-e88f87c320ae",
                                                "sense_id": "9133c0ba-7ca8-35f7-95cd-094e8ca25347",
                                                "text": "„So gehörten ihr herausragende Persönlichkeiten an, beispielsweise der erste Außenminister Chaudhry Zafarullah Khan sowie der einzige Nobelpreisträger Pakistans, Abdus Salam, der diese Auszeichnung 1979 im Fach Physik erhielt.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "872eaffd-af2f-4c0a-ba67-b70e69f578cb",
                                                "sense_id": "9133c0ba-7ca8-35f7-95cd-094e8ca25347",
                                                "text": "„In der Forschung leisteten deutsche Juden Besonderes: Zwischen 1921 und 1931 waren fünf der 15 deutschen Nobelpreisträger jüdische Wissenschaftler, z. B. Albert Einstein.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
